# Blogs are for SEO

Blog posts are the site’s search articles. News is a separate section.

- Public blog URLs stay `/blog` and `/blog/[slug]`.
- A blog article uses the same visual layout as the Kite news article (`content-box news-detail`): title, excerpt, date, category, cover, body, share row, and an “explore more stories” sidebar of other blog posts.
- Keep one `h1` (the post title). Section headings in the body start at `h2`.
- Keep the server metadata, canonical URL, Open Graph tags, and BlogPosting JSON-LD. Do not replace those with a client-only title.
- Write excerpts, meta title, and meta description for search. Do not treat the blog as a copy of the news feed.
